# head/adult/man/brow_arched: the man's arched brows: raised, the outer ends down
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to FACES in wave 2). Every head type keeps A3's eye rows and columns, the nose pixel
# and the mouth row (STYLE_P2 4), so expressions, marks and paint fit them all. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role brow arched
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
tags mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -3 -7
|.bb....bb.
|b........b

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -11 -7
|bb.
|..b

view L key rest origin -2 -7
|.bb
|b..
